#: kcmcss.cpp:31
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Stylesheets</h1> This module allows you to apply your own color "
"and font settings to Konqueror by using stylesheets (CSS). You can either "
"specify options or apply your own self-written stylesheet by pointing to its "
"location."
"<br> Note that these settings will always have precedence before all other "
"settings made by the site author. This can be useful to visually impaired "
"people or for web pages that are unreadable due to bad design."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror Bizütabaqları</h1> Üzençä köylängän yazu-töslär belän "
"bizütabaqlarnıñ (CSS) Konqueror'da qullanuın bu modul aşa köyläp bula. Ul "
"köylämälär üzgärtep tä bula, şulay uq üz yasağan tabaq urınlaşuın da bilgelärgä "
"yarí."
"<br> Belderü: ul bizäleşlär bit eçendäge bizäleş aldınnan qullanıla. Naçar "
"kürüçe keşelärgä, yä ki caysız bizälgän bitlär uqığanda bu köyläwdän uñaylıq "
"kürep bula."

#. i18n: file cssconfig.ui line 20
#: rc.cpp:3 rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<b>Stylesheets</b>"
"<p>See http://www.w3.org/Style/CSS for further information on cascading style "
"sheets.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Bizütabaq</b>"
"<p>Qoymalı bizü tabaqları turında tulırağın http://www.w3.org/Style/CSS for "
"further bitendä tabıp bula.</p>"

#. i18n: file cssconfig.ui line 47
#: rc.cpp:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "&General"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file cssconfig.ui line 72
#: rc.cpp:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stylesheets"
msgstr "Bizütabaq"

#. i18n: file cssconfig.ui line 78
#: rc.cpp:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<b>Stylesheets</b>"
"<p>Use this groupbox to determine how Konqueror will render style sheets.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Bizütabaq</b>"
"<p>Konqueror qaysı bizü tabaqlar qulanırğa tieş buluın bu täräzätä bilgeläp "
"bula.</p>"

#. i18n: file cssconfig.ui line 103
#: rc.cpp:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use &user-defined stylesheet"
msgstr "Ü&zençä bizütabaq qullanası"

#. i18n: file cssconfig.ui line 106
#: rc.cpp:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<b>Use user-defined stylesheet</b>"
"<p>If this box is checked, Konqueror will try to load a user-defined style "
"sheet as specified in the location below. The style sheet allows you to "
"completely override the way web pages are rendered in your browser. The file "
"specified should contain a valid style sheet (see http://www.w3.org/Style/CSS "
"for further information on cascading style sheets).</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Üzençä bizütabaq qullanu</b>"
"<p>Bu köylämä yanıq ikän, Konqueror üz eşe öçen asqaraq äytelgän urınlaşu "
"buyınça bizütabaq yökläp qaraçaq. Ul bizü tabağın qullanıp, web-bitlärneñ "
"gizgeçtä küreşen bötenläy üzgärtep bula. Äytelgän birem tözeleşe tuğrı bulırğa "
"tieş. CSS yäğni qoymalı bizü tabaqları turında belemne "
"http://www.w3.org/Style/CSS säxifäsendä tabıp bula."

